## The driver
BASE=http://localhost:5271 SPEC=... PORT=9826 node docs/research/colour-rail.mjs   (fields written as a user event, read back before the click)
PORT=98xx PDF=... PAGES=... node docs/research/remove-pages-round.mjs            (the same, plus pane and card screenshots)

## The strip: absent on every run
DOM probe after loading colour.pdf: {"thumbs":0,"strip":false,"stripH":null,"disclosure":[],"panel":"closed","stripHtmlLen":0}
one field -> nothing to fold -> no disclosure -> the picker's compact branch never draws the strip (screenshots 1, 3, 4)

## The card counts, and the sheets, per case (spec run, port 9826)
drop2        card "PAGES 4 -> 3 | Removed 1 page, kept 3 pages."   file 3 sheets
annot-drop2  card "PAGES 4 -> 3 | Removed 1 page, kept 3 pages."   file 3 sheets, 3 annots + 1 link on the kept sheet
book-drop4   card + "1 of this document's 3 bookmarks ... were dropped; 2 came with the pages."  toc 3 -> 2, re-pointed to 1 and 2
drop-empty3  card "PAGES 4 -> 3"                                  the empty sheet went, its neighbours did not
all          run button DISABLED, "Still needed: Choose the pages to delete - deleting every page would leave an empty PDF."
spelled-all  same sentence from the run: "Deleting pages 1-4 would remove all 4 pages, leaving an empty PDF." + hint
oob (9 of 4) run button DISABLED, the sentence printed TWICE (picker + field issue) plus "Still needed:"
reversed 4,2 removed 2 kept 2; dupes 2,2 removed 1 kept 3; one-of-one refused with the same sentence

